  "about": "The epistola of the formulary “Queenship of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "I went forth from the mouth of the Most High, the firstborn before every creature; I dwelt in the highest places, and my throne was in a pillar of cloud. I stood in all the earth and among every people, and in every nation I held the first place; and with power I trod upon the hearts of all, the exalted and the lowly. Whoever hears me shall not be confounded, and those who work in me shall not sin; those who make me known shall have eternal life." }
  },
